description:
Thrill-seekers, rejoice!

Parabolica, the ultimate destination for social gaming adventures, invites you to immerse yourself in mind-bending VR experiences like never before.

Located in the heart of Andheri, our cutting-edge facility offers -

1. Arena-scale free roam VR with advanced body haptics & weapon controllers;

2. Multi-disciplinary VR escape rooms featuring award-winning content;

3. Cutting-edge racing simulators equipped with motion chassis, F1 cockpits, and high-torque, force-feedback wheels & pedals;

4. An interactive immersive wall,

5. Captivating 360-degree stadium - VR cricket & golf experience.

From pulse-pounding competitions to mind-boggling mysteries, Parabolica guarantees an extraordinary escape into Another World.
